'''Elder Flame Doron''' (古神炎ドロン, ''Ko Kamien Doron'', '''Ancient God-Flame Doron''') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemy introduced in [[The Face of God]], the final stage in [[Ancient Forest Labyrinth]]. He is the enemy version of [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Elder Mask Doron]]. He was added in [[Version 10.6 Update|Version 10.6]].

